+单轨。settled from source: `docs/adr/0015-desktop-sparkle-and-electron-updater.md` on `main`——
+「The initial channel is stable」，只暴露已发布的完整桌面 release，draft 是审核边界。
+`gh api repos/tommy0103/obelisk/releases?per_page=100`（2026-10-14）: 6 个 release，`prerelease` 全为 false。
